      "id": "claim_cd6d93fd18a647eebeba8650c8b26aae",
      "statement": "The server is a single-wiki, single-process bridge: bootstrap resolves one target server into a ServerConfig, initializes exactly one nodemw Bot against that wiki's API endpoint, and serves one MCP client over a single StdioServerTransport for the lifetime of the process.",
