      "id": "claim_df8225d70b514a479ba04bc634ac83c2",
      "statement": "All mutable process state lives in module-level singletons under src/common — the bot instance, the ServerConfig, the authenticated flag, the cached MediaWiki version, the namespace cache, and the readState/writeCache maps — and tool handlers reach that state through functions such as getBot(), getMediaWikiVersion() and requireRead() rather than an injected request context, so one process serves exactly one wiki and one client session.",
