      "statement": "requireRead(title) always re-resolves the title through getArticleInfo and throws when an existing page's pageid has no read record; it returns 0 for a page that does not exist so creation is never blocked, but it throws when a title this session wrote no longer exists or now resolves to a different pageid than the cached write.",
